    {
      "id": "claim_261c08c11abf42b7828ab29234784d4b",
      "statement": "BaseSandbox does not reduce or partition the trust boundary of execute(); its helper methods assume any caller who can use the backend already has whatever shell-execution capability the backend exposes.",
