      "id": "claim_d3eac949c9304cdfbee1be29930db8fa",
      "statement": "BaseSandbox caps read() text output at roughly 500 KiB via MAX_OUTPUT_BYTES (and binary previews via MAX_BINARY_BYTES) to avoid backend stdout/log transport failures, appending TRUNCATION_MSG to guide pagination when the cap is exceeded.",
