      "id": "claim_6c6cdaebbd8d408fba9a470d54419fcf",
      "statement": "DaytonaSandbox subclasses BaseSandbox and implements execute() by running the command asynchronously in a per-command Daytona session, polling the session command status until an exit code appears (polling delay controlled by sync_polling_interval) and then collecting session logs, returning exit code 124 on timeout; timeout=0 means wait indefinitely.",
