      "statement": "ModalSandbox subclasses BaseSandbox and implements execute() via sandbox.exec(\"bash\", \"-c\", command, timeout=...), combining stdout and stderr, with file transfer using the Modal sandbox open()/read()/write() and id set to the Modal object_id; timeout=0 means wait indefinitely.",
