      "statement": "VercelSandbox subclasses BaseSandbox, wraps an existing vercel.sandbox.Sandbox, rejects a negative default timeout with ValueError, treats timeout=0 as wait indefinitely, and exposes the Vercel sandbox_id as its id.",
